+/*
+ * llm_server: minimal OpenAI-compatible HTTP server on top of the TensorRT Edge-LLM runtime.
+ *
+ * Loads one engine directory once, keeps it resident, and serves
+ *   POST /v1/chat/completions   (stream: true -> SSE; stream: false -> JSON)
+ *   GET  /v1/models
+ *   GET  /health
+ * Requests are executed one at a time (single GPU engine, serialized by a mutex).
+ * Tools: OpenAI `tools` are rendered into the system prompt in Qwen's native format and
+ * `<tool_call>{...}</tool_call>` blocks in the output are returned as `tool_calls`.
+ * No external HTTP library: a small HTTP/1.1 parser over POSIX sockets (single request per connection).
+ */
+
